<in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock contextRef="OneD">Please refer enclosed pdf of Financial Results for Notes on Financial Results.      Clarification - In the statement of consolidated audited financial results for the quarter and year ended March 31, 2022 filed with stock exchanges (“Statement”),  Share of Net Profit of a Joint Venture Accounted for using the Equity Method  has been shown as line item after  Profit before Share of Profit of a Joint Venture, Exceptional Items and Tax . Hence, the figures for  Total profit before exceptional items and tax  and  Total profit before tax  given here are not matching with the  Profit before exceptional items and tax  and  Profit before Tax  in the Statement.      Clarification for Cash Flow Indirect:      1.In the statement of consolidated unaudited financial results for the quarter and year ended March 31, 2022 filed with stock exchanges (“Statement”),  Share of Net Profit of a Joint Venture Accounted for using the Equity Method  has been shown as line item after  Profit before Share of Profit of a Joint Venture, Exceptional Items and Tax  . Whereas Profit before tax considered here in the  Cash Flow Indirect  is before the  Share of Net profit of a Joint Venture Accounted for using the Equity Method . Hence, Profit before tax of Rs. 1924.52 Crore given here is not matching with Profit before Tax of Rs. 2230.90 Crore. In view of above, Adjustments for share of Profit of a Joint Venture of Rs. 306.38 Crore given in Consolidated statement of cash flows for the year ended filed with Stock Exchange is not shown here.      Adjustments for cash flow from operating activities:      2. Other adjustments for which cash effects are investing or financing cash flow of Rs. 81.09  Crore is the sum of (Gain) on sale of Current Investments of Rs. (8.11) Crore, Realised Foreign Exchange Variation (Gain) / Loss of Rs. (0.05) Crore , Effective portion of Exchange Difference Loss on Hedging Instruments re-classified to Profit or Loss of Rs. 94.17 Crore and (Gain) / Loss on Disposal of Property, Plant and Equipment (Net) of Rs. (4.92) Crore.      3.Other adjustments for non-cash items of Rs. (7.63)  Crore is the sum of Allowance for Doubtful Debts and Advances (Net) of Rs. 0.04 Crore, Catalyst Charges written off of Rs. 8.52 Crore, Mark to Market Loss/(Gain) on Derivative Transactions of Rs. (11.68) Crore and Liabilities no longer required written back of Rs. (4.55) Crore and Irrecoverable Balances Written Off of Rs. 0.04 Crore.      Adjustments for cash flow from investing activities:      4.Other Inflows/(Outflows) of cash of Rs.7.85  Crore is the sum of Proceeds from sale of Current Investments of Rs. 8.11 Crore and Fixed Deposits matured / placed (having original maturity of more than three months) of Rs. (0.26) Crore given in Consolidated Statement of Cash flows for the year ended March 31, 2022 filed with Stock exchange.      Adjustments for cash flow from financing activities:      5. Proceeds from exercise of stock options given here represents Receipt of amount from CFCL Employees Welfare Trust of Rs. 1.89 Crore given in Consolidated Statement of Cash flows for the year ended March 31, 2022 filed with Stock exchange.</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
